	["更新_内容标题_2"]={"全新更新！✨","New Update! ✨"},
	["更新_内容_2_1"]={"💰 货币样式升级<br/>你的金币资源现在有了全新样子！<br/><br/>🏆 称号重写<br/>部分称号已进行了更新。<br/><br/>🕹 新增主机支持<br/>现在你可以在主机上畅玩游戏！","💰 Currency Makeover<br/>Your coins now have a brand-new look!<br/><br/>🏆 Titles Rewritten<br/>Some titles have been updated.<br/><br/>🕹 Console Support<br/>You can now play on console!"},
	["更新_内容标题_3"]={"🌟 今日更新！🌟","🌟 UPDATE TODAY! 🌟"},
	["更新_内容_3_1"]={"重大更新来啦！全新内容、成长玩法与魔法系统等你来探索！","A major new update has arrived, bringing new content, progression, and magical systems to explore!"},
	["更新_内容_3_2"]={"✨ <font color='#9879CD'>流动商人登场</font><br/>流动商人将随机出现在地图各处，并出售各种稀有道具！<br/><br/>⚗️ <font color='#9879CD'>自动炼金</font><br/>自动炼金功能现已开放，同时优化了炼金材料计算与制作机制。<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#9879CD'>表情动作更新</font><br/>新增多种动画效果，并对表情系统进行了优化。<br/><br/>🌿 <font color='#9879CD'>德鲁伊活动延期</font><br/>全新召唤物与强力活动 Boss 现已加入！<br/><br/>🎉 <font color='#9879CD'>神秘服务器事件</font><br/>随机服务器事件现已开启，为所有在线玩家提供特殊增益与奖励！<br/><br/>⚙️ <font color='#9879CD'>优化与改进</font><br/>• 技能平衡调整<br/>• 炼药系统优化<br/>• 多项体验与性能优化","✨ <font color='#9879CD'>Traveling Merchant Added</font><br/>Find the Traveling Merchant at random locations and discover special items for sale!<br/><br/>⚗️ <font color='#9879CD'>Auto Alchemy</font><br/>Auto Alchemy is now available, with improvements to material calculations and crafting mechanics.<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#9879CD'>EMOTE Update</font><br/>New animations and emote improvements have been added.<br/><br/>🌿 <font color='#9879CD'>Druid Event Extended</font><br/>A brand-new summon and a powerful new boss have arrived!<br/><br/>🎉<font color='#9879CD'> Mystery Server Events</font><br/>Random server-wide events can now occur, granting special buffs and bonuses to all players online.<br/><br/>⚙️ <font color='#9879CD'>Improvements</font><br/>• Skill balancing adjustments<br/>• Brewing system optimizations<br/>• Quality-of-life improvements"},
	["更新_内容_3_3"]={"更多冒险正等着你，巫师！快来体验本次更新吧！","More adventures await, Wizard. Jump in and explore the update now!"},
	["更新_内容标题_4"]={"🌿 德鲁伊活动更新 🌿","🌿 Druid Event Update 🌿"},
	["更新_内容_4_1"]={"自然之力正在觉醒……全新的德鲁伊主题活动即将登陆 Wizard Alchemy！","The power of nature awakens... A brand new Druid-themed Event is arriving in Wizard Alchemy!"},
	["更新_内容_4_2"]={"🧙‍♂️ <font color='#74af53'>全新活动内容</font><br/>新增召唤类型法术<br/>全新活动专属区域<br/>活动限定武器、服装、帽子与扫帚皮肤<br/>可通过活动积分商店兑换奖励<br/>限时收藏称号<br/>活动排行榜<br/><br/>📱 <font color='#74af53'>平台优化</font><br/>新增移动端蓝牙手柄支持<br/>优化移动端整体游玩体验<br/><br/>🛠️ <font color='#74af53'>修复与优化</font><br/>多项 Bug 修复<br/>性能优化<br/>反作弊系统优化与加强","🧙‍♂️ <font color='#74af53'>New Event Content</font><br/>New summon-type spells<br/>Brand-new event-exclusive area<br/>Event-limited weapons, outfits, hats and broom skins<br/>Redeem rewards in the event points shop<br/>Limited-time collectible titles<br/>Event leaderboard<br/><br/>📱 <font color='#74af53'>Platform Improvements</font><br/>Bluetooth controller support on mobile<br/>Improved overall mobile experience<br/><br/>🛠️ <font color='#74af53'>Fixes & Improvements</font><br/>Multiple bug fixes<br/>Performance optimizations<br/>Improved and strengthened anti-cheat"},
	["更新_内容_4_3"]={"做好准备迎接德鲁伊的崛起，驾驭自然之力吧！🌿","Prepare yourself for the rise of the druids and harness the power of nature! 🌿"},
	["更新_内容标题_5"]={"🧙‍♂️ 更新已上线！🧙‍♀️","🧙‍♂️ UPDATE IS LIVE! 🧙‍♀️"},
	["更新_内容_5_1"]={"✨ <font color='#9879CD'>流动商人登场</font><br/>流动商人将随机出现在地图各处，并出售各种稀有道具！<br/><br/>⚗️ <font color='#9879CD'>自动炼金</font><br/>自动炼金功能现已开放，同时优化了炼金材料计算与制作机制。<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#9879CD'>表情动作更新</font><br/>新增多种动画效果，并对表情系统进行了优化。<br/><br/>🌿 <font color='#9879CD'>德鲁伊活动延期</font><br/>全新召唤物与强力活动 Boss 现已加入！<br/><br/>🎉 <font color='#9879CD'>神秘服务器事件</font><br/>随机服务器事件现已开启，为所有在线玩家提供特殊增益与奖励！<br/><br/>⚙️ <font color='#9879CD'>优化与改进</font><br/>• 技能平衡调整<br/>• 炼药系统优化<br/>• 多项体验与性能优化","✨ <font color='#9879CD'>Traveling Merchant Added</font><br/>Find the Traveling Merchant at random locations and discover special items for sale!<br/><br/>⚗️ <font color='#9879CD'>Auto Alchemy</font><br/>Auto Alchemy is now available, with improvements to material calculations and crafting mechanics.<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#9879CD'>EMOTE Update</font><br/>New animations and emote improvements have been added.<br/><br/>🌿 <font color='#9879CD'>Druid Event Extended</font><br/>A brand-new summon and a powerful new boss have arrived!<br/><br/>🎉<font color='#9879CD'> Mystery Server Events</font><br/>Random server-wide events can now occur, granting special buffs and bonuses to all players online.<br/><br/>⚙️ <font color='#9879CD'>Improvements</font><br/>• Skill balancing adjustments<br/>• Brewing system optimizations<br/>• Quality-of-life improvements"},
	["更新_内容_5_2"]={"做好准备迎接德鲁伊的崛起，驾驭自然之力吧！🌿","Prepare yourself for the rise of the druids and harness the power of nature! 🌿"},
	["更新_内容标题_6"]={"🏴‍☠️ Wizard Alchemy 更新已上线！🧙‍♀️","🏴‍☠️ Wizard Alchemy Update is Live! 🧙‍♀️"},
	["更新_内容_6_1"]={"最新更新现已上线！以下是更新内容：","The latest update is now available! Here's what's new:"},
	["更新_内容_6_2"]={"✨ <font color='#ffaa00'>全新 2-2 岛屿</font><br/>踏上全新的海盗主题岛屿，开启充满未知与冒险的旅程！<br/><br/>🗺️ <font color='#ffaa00'>全新剧情任务</font><br/>跟随故事线寻找传说中的海盗宝藏，体验独特机制、互动解谜以及沉浸式场景探索。<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#ffaa00'>新增 10 个表情动作</font><br/>新增 10 款全新 表情动作，等待 Boss、交易或与好友互动时都能尽情展示个性！<br/><br/>🧪 <font color='#ffaa00'>新增药水与技能</font><br/>解锁并掌握全新的药水与技能，探索更多战斗与炼金玩法。<br/><br/>☀️ <font color='#ffaa00'>太阳耀斑 技能优化</font><br/>根据社区玩家的反馈，对 太阳耀斑 技能进行了优化与调整，带来更好的使用体验。","✨ <font color='#ffaa00'>Brand-New Island 2-2</font><br/>Set foot on a brand-new pirate-themed island and begin a journey full of mystery and adventure!<br/><br/>🗺️ <font color='#ffaa00'>New Story Quests</font><br/>Follow the storyline to hunt for legendary pirate treasure, with unique mechanics, interactive puzzles and immersive exploration.<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#ffaa00'>10 New Emotes</font><br/>10 brand-new emotes have been added. Show off your style while waiting for Bosses, trading, or hanging out with friends!<br/><br/>🧪 <font color='#ffaa00'>New Potions & Skills</font><br/>Unlock and master new potions and skills, and explore more combat and alchemy gameplay.<br/><br/>☀️ <font color='#ffaa00'>Solar Flare Improvements</font><br/>Based on community feedback, the Solar Flare skill has been optimized and adjusted for a better experience."},
	["更新_内容_6_3"]={"做好准备迎接德鲁伊的崛起，驾驭自然之力吧！🌿","Prepare yourself for the rise of the druids and harness the power of nature! 🌿"},
	["更新_内容标题_7"]={"🏴‍☠️ 海盗宠物活动来袭！🐾","🏴‍☠️ Pirate Pet Event Has Arrived! 🐾"},
	["更新_内容_7_1"]={"海盗宠物活动现已开启！","The Pirate Pet Event is now live!"},
	["更新_内容_7_2"]={"✨ <font color='#ffaa00'>全新 2-2 岛屿</font><br/>踏上全新的海盗主题岛屿，开启充满未知与冒险的旅程！<br/><br/>🗺️ <font color='#ffaa00'>全新剧情任务</font><br/>跟随故事线寻找传说中的海盗宝藏，体验独特机制、互动解谜以及沉浸式场景探索。<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#ffaa00'>新增 10 个表情动作</font><br/>新增 10 款全新 表情动作，等待 Boss、交易或与好友互动时都能尽情展示个性！<br/><br/>🧪 <font color='#ffaa00'>新增药水与技能</font><br/>解锁并掌握全新的药水与技能，探索更多战斗与炼金玩法。<br/><br/>☀️ <font color='#ffaa00'>太阳耀斑 技能优化</font><br/>根据社区玩家的反馈，对 太阳耀斑 技能进行了优化与调整，带来更好的使用体验。","✨ <font color='#ffaa00'>Brand-New Island 2-2</font><br/>Set foot on a brand-new pirate-themed island and begin a journey full of mystery and adventure!<br/><br/>🗺️ <font color='#ffaa00'>New Story Quests</font><br/>Follow the storyline to hunt for legendary pirate treasure, with unique mechanics, interactive puzzles and immersive exploration.<br/><br/>🎭 <font color='#ffaa00'>10 New Emotes</font><br/>10 brand-new emotes have been added. Show off your style while waiting for Bosses, trading, or hanging out with friends!<br/><br/>🧪 <font color='#ffaa00'>New Potions & Skills</font><br/>Unlock and master new potions and skills, and explore more combat and alchemy gameplay.<br/><br/>☀️ <font color='#ffaa00'>Solar Flare Improvements</font><br/>Based on community feedback, the Solar Flare skill has been optimized and adjusted for a better experience."},
	["更新_内容_7_3"]={"做好准备迎接德鲁伊的崛起，驾驭自然之力吧！🌿","Prepare yourself for the rise of the druids and harness the power of nature! 🌿"},
	["更新_内容标题_8"]={"🏴‍☠️ 海盗宠物活动来袭！🐾","🏴‍☠️ Pirate Pet Event Has Arrived! 🐾"},
	["更新_内容_8_1"]={"🌴 <font color='#9879CD'>全新内容</font><br/>新增一座全新主题岛屿<br/>新增探索玩法机制<br/>新增挑战 Boss<br/>新增药水<br/>新增装备<br/><br/>☠️ <font color='#9879CD'>全新元素</font><br/>新增 毒（Poison）元素<br/>体验全新的毒系能力与药水效果<br/><br/>🌟 <font color='#9879CD'>元素特性系统</font><br/>万众期待的元素特性系统正式上线！<br/>首批开放特性：<br/>  ☠️ 毒<br/>  🌟 空间<br/>尝试不同元素组合，打造更强大的战斗流派。<br/><br/>⚔️ <font color='#9879CD'>全新种族</font><br/>新增两个全新种族：<br/>  ⭐ 史诗<br/>  🌟 传说<br/>其中 传说种族 将与全新的元素特性深度联动，拥有更加强大的能力。","🌴 <font color='#9879CD'>New Content</font><br/>A brand-new themed island<br/>New exploration mechanics<br/>New Boss challenges<br/>New potions<br/>New equipment<br/><br/>☠️ <font color='#9879CD'>New Element</font><br/>Poison element added<br/>Try out brand-new poison abilities and potion effects<br/><br/>🌟 <font color='#9879CD'>Element Traits</font><br/>The long-awaited Element Trait system is now live!<br/>First traits available:<br/>  ☠️ Poison<br/>  🌟 Space<br/>Mix different elements to build stronger combat styles.<br/><br/>⚔️ <font color='#9879CD'>New Races</font><br/>Two brand-new races added:<br/>  ⭐ Epic<br/>  🌟 Legendary<br/>The Legendary race links deeply with the new element traits and holds even greater power."},
